{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52928","headline":"颂 二 · 拾得","name":"颂 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东阳海水清，水清复见底。\n灵源流法泉，斫水刀而痕。\n我见顽愚士，灯心拄须弥。\n寸樵煮大海，足抹大地石，蒸沙成饭无，磨甎将爲镜。\n说食终不饱，直须着力行。\n恢恢大丈夫，堂堂六尺土。\n枉死埋塚下，可惜孤标物。\n（同前书卷三十三。\n此条承陈允吉师告知）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"拾得","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52928.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52928","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}